<title>USA: Consolidated Products to offer 1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Consolidated Products to offer 1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated Products Inc said Wednesday that it will offer up to one million shares of its common stock, subject to market conditions and regulatory requirements.</p>
<p>The company said none of the shares will be sold by shareholders and the offering is not underwritten.</p>
<p>It said proceeds will be used to finance the development of new &quot;Steak n Shake&quot; restaurants, the renovation of existing restaurants and for general corporate purposes.</p>
</text>
